/* What a Tactility device app exports: nothing.
 *
 * elf_loader resolves every symbol a relocation names through Tactility's
 * export tables, even one the app defines itself; it never looks in the app.
 * Anything the app exports (a template instantiated from libstdc++'s headers,
 * which are default visibility; a package class marked for export to the
 * editor's DLLs) is referred to by name, and the load fails with "Can't find
 * common <name>". Kept local, those references are plain relative addresses.
 * The loader starts the app at the ELF's entry address, not by symbol.
 */
{
    local: *;
};
